{"id":"91bad7e9096c3b8f","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-jump-traceable.md","title":"跳跃可迹性","display":"df-jump-traceable — 跳跃可迹性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-jump-traceable","aliases":["43-df-jump-traceable"],"display":"df-jump-traceable — 跳跃可迹性","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-order-function]]","[[43-df-ce-trace]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.15.1.25, printed p.424 / PDF p.444","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-jump-traceable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-jump-traceable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-traceable — 跳跃可迹性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea6b8d0468b95296\" href=\"?note=ea6b8d0468b95296\" title=\"43-df-ce-trace\">43-df-ce-trace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.15.1.25, printed p.424 / PDF p.444"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\">\\(\\Phi_e^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CETrace}\">\\(\\mathrm{CETrace}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ea6b8d0468b95296\" href=\"?note=ea6b8d0468b95296\" title=\"43-df-ce-trace\">43-df-ce-trace</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 下式限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J^A:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(J^A:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> 由下式函数图定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(J^A)\\coloneqq\\{(e,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow=y\\}.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{JumpTraceable}(A)\\iff\\exists h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\,[\\mathrm{Order}(h)\\land\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,J^A,h)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{graph}(J^A)\\coloneqq\\{(e,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow=y\\}.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{JumpTraceable}(A)\\iff\\exists h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\,[\\mathrm{Order}(h)\\land\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,J^A,h)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>J^A 是部分自然数值对角函数，区别于表示其定义域的集合 A′；这一类型区别是跳跃迹定义的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7144eefd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-order-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce-trace","status":"resolved","id":"ea6b8d0468b95296","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A$ 见 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]；$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]。$h$ 下式限于 $\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$J^A:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 由下式函数图定义。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7144eefd8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A$ 见 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]；$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]。$h$ 下式限于 $\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$J^A:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 由下式函数图定义。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce-trace","status":"resolved","id":"ea6b8d0468b95296","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hyp